{"summary":"Kakuro, a logic-based math puzzle with a modern layout!","description":"Kakuro (originally called Cross Sums) is a logic-based, math puzzle. The objective of the puzzle is to insert a digit from 1 to 9 inclusive into each white cell such that the sum of the numbers in each entry matches the clue associated with it and that no digit is duplicated in any entry.\n\n<b>FEATURES:</b>\n- modern layout\n- five different difficulties\n- hundreds of puzzles for each difficulty\n- auto-save your progress for each puzzle\n- unlimited undo/redo\n- color input system for experts\n- clean interface and smooth controls\n- google play games achievements\n- phones and tablets support\n\n<b>HELPFUL FEATURES (optional):</b>\n- selection modes: select first or number first\n- pencil modes: automatic or manual\n- keyboard configuration: auto, three rows, two rows, one row\n- direction highlight: vertical and horizontal highlight\n- rule violations: game rule warnings highlight\n- sum errors: calculate if the sum is correct or not\n- sum combinations: show all possible combinations\n- multiple color input (advanced): use different colors to place numbers\n- automatic error detection: show errors automatically\n- bigger numbers: large font for better visualization","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$1.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Tg-kSdX-_9w?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ZOWfrQHx_OXirxPyApRXWl0bwkorCP8dyRPBSD8QXUuGLM2IPjNHpH80BiyEovfUY7arCnZhCDaQq0ndaGLrrA","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Z5E-NK4cX-ghG9OR-JfIX-YamQS2mMWagOoZjKPWWn1ftO7K2jxuwDXgym9Eqmlv3U7j816ZxrMtQvgQagINsDM","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/CxiB2sGoY0E0IiNXWNmFKl9OT-9bUTSdwrpsC1d4qkfmk4nmgm7_aerg6L84y79JFvpdfJvLPEKbUu7FLRpX2A","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bfwpVe7XKIkIQmphdrwle-DUXrGX1K58CmAT1m0De9xfoz6wIOuqnorJpCZnTE45Q0lL1oDL0ShyT1jRfhny","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aEH